    "desc_detail": "[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"!ALL ITEMS ON SALE ARE FINAL SALE!\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Transform Your Lips with BASMA Blurring Gloss Balm\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"✨ Discover the ultimate lip treatment: the BASMA Blurring Gloss Balm – a viral 3-in-1 formula. It combines hydration, pigmentation, and shine. This innovative balm blurs fine lines, leaving your lips silky and juicy. Perfect for those seeking a TikTok beauty must-have.\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Key Benefits\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"• Intense hydration ensures soft, smooth lips.\\n• High-pigment payoff for a bold look.\\n• Ultra-glossy finish for a radiant glow.\\n• Instantly blurs lip lines for a flawless appearance.\\n• Non-sticky and non-gritty texture.\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nourishing Ingredients\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"🌿 Formulated with ginseng extract for fine line reduction. Vitamin E provides deep hydration. Passionfruit extract offers anti-inflammatory and skin-softening properties. Castor oil delivers replenishing moisture, preventing dryness. Each application gives you pigmented lips and extra shine. 0.18 oz / 5.5 g.\"}]",
